Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:20.61,Fuusen Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k16}{\k71}Tsu{\k27}ra{\k23}nu{\k45}i{\k45}te {\k26}ya{\k36}rou{\k12}ze
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:06.32,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,My heart spins like a restless fan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:10.16,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,as it whirls around and around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:13.79,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,Our conversation keeps getting cut short
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:17.46,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,interrupted again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:25.05,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,Hanging upside down from the steel bars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:28.51,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,I steal a kiss from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:35.73,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,A scooter races by, shouting, “Keep going!”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:44.19,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,and our days rewind once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:48.53,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,Chewing bubblegum, chew-chew-chew
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:51.45,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,even if we live on corny jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.45,0:23:55.62,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,The cutting edge of our souls
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:58.79,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,still shines razor-sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:03.17,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,When my bubblegum pops,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.17,0:24:06.21,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,that s when we ll head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.17,0:24:06.21,Fuusen Translation,\pos(252;563),0,0,0,,{\pos(252,563)}'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.17,0:24:06.21,Fuusen Translation,\pos(410;561),0,0,0,,{\pos(410,561)}'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.22,0:24:10.26,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,The more we chew, the richer the flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:13.89,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,like old souls who grow cooler with time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.89,0:24:17.60,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,Let s hold on to our own ideals
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.89,0:24:17.60,Fuusen Translation,\pos(213;560),0,0,0,,{\pos(213,560)}'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:20.61,Fuusen Translation,,0,0,0,,And see them through to the end!
